    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parking Simulator \u2013 Keys, Chaos, and the Night Shift!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dusty cashier, an old keychain, and a long list of customer complaints.<br>This parking lot was left to you by your grandfather.<br>It\u2019s falling apart... but it\u2019s yours now.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GREET CUSTOMERS, PARK CARS, HANDLE CASH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city\u2019s drivers flood your lot\u2014each with their own quirks.<br>Impatient. Elderly. VIPs. Angry.<br>Scan their barcodes. Take their payments.<br>And don\u2019t mess up\u2014small mistakes turn into big complaints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/54e589346de4bf6c6e59e8a787f8c552.poster.avif?t=1754494902\" width=798 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/54e589346de4bf6c6e59e8a787f8c552.webm?t=1754494902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/54e589346de4bf6c6e59e8a787f8c552.mp4?t=1754494902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEYS, VALETS, AND MANAGED MAYHEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the lot gets busy, hire valets to help.<br>Every car has a key. Every key must be tagged right.<br>Mess it up? Get ready for angry reviews and refunds.<br>Train your team. Rotate shifts. Keep everything under control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE NIGHT BRINGS DANGER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, shadows move differently.<br>Thieves sneak into your lot. They damage cars. They steal cash.<br>Install lights, place cameras, hire guards.<br>Each loss hurts your brand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/50d189c1b0d2410ecad896ab3aa5b78c.poster.avif?t=1754494902\" width=798 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/50d189c1b0d2410ecad896ab3aa5b78c.webm?t=1754494902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/50d189c1b0d2410ecad896ab3aa5b78c.mp4?t=1754494902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FROM TINY LOT TO PARKING EMPIRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to unlock new spaces, add lighting and d\u00e9cor, and improve customer experience.<br>Add idle income zones. Make your lot more than just a parking space\u2014it\u2019s a business now.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add to Wishlist and Start Building Your Parking Legacy!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keys get lost. Customers rage. Thieves lurk in the dark.<br>Being a valet in this city isn\u2019t easy.<br>But if you play it right\u2026 you\u2019ll build an empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/51ed982d4199341c89019b21655f4691.poster.avif?t=1754494902\" width=798 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/51ed982d4199341c89019b21655f4691.webm?t=1754494902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846650/extras/51ed982d4199341c89019b21655f4691.mp4?t=1754494902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
